sequenceDiagram
  participant F as Ravel formula
  participant B as brew
  participant K as Skill formula keg
  participant D as Default skill directory
  participant R as Ravel launch
  F->>F: Write share/ravel/installation.json<br/>skillDirectory = HOMEBREW_PREFIX/share/ravel/skills
  B->>K: Install the payload libexec/skill-sources/ID
  B->>K: Install the source alias share/ravel/skills/ID<br/>a relative directory symlink to the payload
  B->>D: Link the entry ID to the alias in the keg
  Note over B,D: Another keg links into the directory<br/>The alias stays one entry, and brew never enters the payload
  R->>D: Read the record, list the entries
  R->>K: Capture ID through the entry and the alias<br/>originPath names the payload
  Note over B,D: brew upgrade of the skill formula
  B->>D: Unlink the earlier keg: ID absent
  R->>D: List the entries: ID absent, no refusal<br/>A mandatory file in ID refuses
  B->>K: Install the new keg
  B->>D: Link the new keg: ID present again
  R->>K: A rerun captures the new payload
